(4850525, 703935, 15711, '<td valign="top">A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I like the image but to me it doesn''t meet the definition.</td>', 'A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I like the image but to me it doesn''t meet the definition.', '2008-07-30 01:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850526, 704183, 15711, '<td valign="top">A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I don''t see that this suits that definition.</td>', 'A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I don''t see that this suits that definition.', '2008-07-30 01:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850528, 704187, 37252, '<td valign="top">A bit cluttered, maybe removing the bow and the object below the drawer would help. The lighting on the beads is a bit harsh. Assuming the beads were the subject here, I would have liked to see them in sharper focus. I do like the perspective you shot this at.</td>', 'A bit cluttered, maybe removing the bow and the object below the drawer would help. The lighting on the beads is a bit harsh. Assuming the beads were the subject here, I would have liked to see them in sharper focus. I do like the perspective you shot this at.', '2008-07-30 01:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
