(4850534, 703713, 15711, '<td valign="top">A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I just don''t think that meets the definition.</td>', 'A still life is a work of art depicting inanimate subject matter, typically commonplace objects which may be either natural (food, plants and natural substances like rocks) or man-made (drinking glasses, cigarettes, pipes, hotdogs and so on) in an artificial setting. I just don''t think that meets the definition.', '2008-07-30 01:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4850541, 703488, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle to shoot this from. I think the lighting is poor though. The area best lit is not the focus point, and just makes the rest feel rather flat.</td>', 'Interesting angle to shoot this from. I think the lighting is poor though. The area best lit is not the focus point, and just makes the rest feel rather flat.', '2008-07-30 01:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
