(4851527, 702989, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge in which most photos aren''t actually still lifes. The crease in the cloth is not adding anything, but it''s also not distracting enough to be bothersome. Love the light you achieved - looks like natural, but I could be wrong. In any case, this is a lovely image.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge in which most photos aren''t actually still lifes. The crease in the cloth is not adding anything, but it''s also not distracting enough to be bothersome. Love the light you achieved - looks like natural, but I could be wrong. In any case, this is a lovely image.', '2008-07-30 16:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
