(4851915, 703294, 93696, '<td valign="top">The colors seem very unnatural in this lighting. Perhaps you could have worked a bit more with adjusting the exposure value and boosting up the colors a bit?</td>', 'The colors seem very unnatural in this lighting. Perhaps you could have worked a bit more with adjusting the exposure value and boosting up the colors a bit?', '2008-07-30 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
