(4852067, 704092, 77196, '<td valign="top">Go Jokers. I think this is a sleeper - people can''t relate to it, don''t understand it, find it disquieting. That is what makes it great, but probably isn''t going to help your score. You''ll have to admit (after voting) - it is unique.</td>', 'Go Jokers. I think this is a sleeper - people can''t relate to it, don''t understand it, find it disquieting. That is what makes it great, but probably isn''t going to help your score. You''ll have to admit (after voting) - it is unique.', '2008-07-30 21:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4852068, 703767, 41337, '<td valign="top">I can''t fault anything about it except that the idea is very old and you didn''t add anything to the concept other than to reshoot it and in that you did very well. The lighting is exquisite.</td>', 'I can''t fault anything about it except that the idea is very old and you didn''t add anything to the concept other than to reshoot it and in that you did very well. The lighting is exquisite.', '2008-07-30 21:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
