(4852717, 704165, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The lighting is unfortunately poor with very little effective contrast. . There is no depth to the image...needs. I think a few nuts and the cone on a contrasting background would have been sufficient to express your idea and emotion for fall. Good idea. 5 for the effort.</td>', 'I like the idea. The lighting is unfortunately poor with very little effective contrast. . There is no depth to the image...needs. I think a few nuts and the cone on a contrasting background would have been sufficient to express your idea and emotion for fall. Good idea. 5 for the effort.', '2008-07-31 01:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
