(4855595, 704002, 74015, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject, with great control of DOF and lighting.  I like that you included a bit of the table underneath the seeds, the color of it fits nicely.  I just wish the BG was more uniform, to better offset the dill (?) seeds.</td>', 'Lovely subject, with great control of DOF and lighting.  I like that you included a bit of the table underneath the seeds, the color of it fits nicely.  I just wish the BG was more uniform, to better offset the dill (?) seeds.', '2008-08-01 11:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855607, 704167, 74015, '<td valign="top"><b>great, great, great image </b>- just not a still life to me...  To be fair with others, I have to give this a lower score but please don''t be put off by that.  You have great talent and this picture, in another challenge, would finish top 5.  Keep it up!</td>', 'great, great, great image - just not a still life to me...  To be fair with others, I have to give this a lower score but please don''t be put off by that.  You have great talent and this picture, in another challenge, would finish top 5.  Keep it up!', '2008-08-01 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855623, 704474, 74015, '<td valign="top">Positives: the touch of red, to complement the blues of the rosary, its placement according to the rule of thirds<br/>negatives: a little overexposed and the bottom right corner is a little empty - it doesn''t visually balance the rest of the image.</td>', 'Positives: the touch of red, to complement the blues of the rosary, its placement according to the rule of thirdsnegatives: a little overexposed and the bottom right corner is a little empty - it doesn''t visually balance the rest of the image.', '2008-08-01 11:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855634, 703848, 74015, '<td valign="top">Positives: great tonal range and good use of B&amp;W.  Some will scold you for leaving dead space on the top third but I actually like it - it''s like it is a continuation of the stem of the pear...<br/>Negatives: the 2 white spots at the top - they disrupt the peacefulness of the still life</td>', 'Positives: great tonal range and good use of B&W.  Some will scold you for leaving dead space on the top third but I actually like it - it''s like it is a continuation of the stem of the pear...Negatives: the 2 white spots at the top - they disrupt the peacefulness of the still life', '2008-08-01 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855639, 704421, 74015, '<td valign="top">positives: the composition, the lighting (which can be tricly with reflective surface) and the colors<br/>negatives: I can''t figure out what they are...</td>', 'positives: the composition, the lighting (which can be tricly with reflective surface) and the colorsnegatives: I can''t figure out what they are...', '2008-08-01 11:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855646, 704408, 74015, '<td valign="top">I wish you had taken the opportunity to hide a secret message within the letters - that''s the first thing I looked for...  A good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I wish you had taken the opportunity to hide a secret message within the letters - that''s the first thing I looked for...  A good shot nonetheless.', '2008-08-01 11:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855656, 704215, 74015, '<td valign="top">positives: great color, DOF and nice rendition of the fuzziness of the peaches<br/>negatives: because of that very same fuzziness, the image lacks contrast</td>', 'positives: great color, DOF and nice rendition of the fuzziness of the peachesnegatives: because of that very same fuzziness, the image lacks contrast', '2008-08-01 11:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
