(4856287, 703886, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The smoke could have been saved from being blown out. The main requirements for smoke pics are adequate lighting and more DOF. The light should be adequate enough to keep a faster shutter speed and more DOF. Here the shutter speed seems to be fine, but not the DOF. But a nice idea with a decent execution.</td>', 'Good idea. The smoke could have been saved from being blown out. The main requirements for smoke pics are adequate lighting and more DOF. The light should be adequate enough to keep a faster shutter speed and more DOF. Here the shutter speed seems to be fine, but not the DOF. But a nice idea with a decent execution.', '2008-08-01 13:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
