(4856326, 703535, 74911, '<td valign="top">Different choice of subject. The arrangement is a but symmetrical, it is very easy to pay less attention to the other half of the image once it gives the feeling that it is symmetric.</td>', 'Different choice of subject. The arrangement is a but symmetrical, it is very easy to pay less attention to the other half of the image once it gives the feeling that it is symmetric.', '2008-08-01 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
