(4859709, 704481, 41337, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 6 when I first saw it. I don''t think I''ve seen jello done that way before so that was clever and the execution was good. I wasn''t crazy about the color you chose for the background (just too much of the same color) but otherwise a good shot. Since it''s not my favorite thing and it offers no emotive value the best score I''ve ever given for this type of shot is an 8 so keep that in mind. <br/> <br/>Oh and yes I guessed this was yours. Now fix your email!</td>', 'I gave this one a 6 when I first saw it. I don''t think I''ve seen jello done that way before so that was clever and the execution was good. I wasn''t crazy about the color you chose for the background (just too much of the same color) but otherwise a good shot. Since it''s not my favorite thing and it offers no emotive value the best score I''ve ever given for this type of shot is an 8 so keep that in mind.  Oh and yes I guessed this was yours. Now fix your email!', '2008-08-02 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
