(4862942, 703623, 23002, '<td valign="top">I know you have already heard it....but this is way to dark.  I can make out the top of what looks like 3 jugs, and then a tiny bit of the shoulders of them but that is it.<br/> <br/>My monitor is calibrated properly.  I know this is supposed to be low key, but this is to dark even for that.</td>', 'I know you have already heard it....but this is way to dark.  I can make out the top of what looks like 3 jugs, and then a tiny bit of the shoulders of them but that is it. My monitor is calibrated properly.  I know this is supposed to be low key, but this is to dark even for that.', '2008-08-04 01:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
