(4868599, 704173, 41337, '<td valign="top">Yeah you would be crazy to think this wouldn''t do well. Now I''m getting tired of congratulating you so I''ll just be posting Irene fun facts from now on. :)<br/> <br/><b>Irene Fun Fact #1</b> (and yanko is very jealous of this. :P):<br/> <br/>- Not only is Irene very good but she sure can pick em! When she scores 6.5 or higher she has won a ribbon 40% of the time! That''s either very high or my percentage is low (i.e. 18%). So now that we got that out of the way can you PM me which challenges to enter and which to avoide? Thanks! Did I tell you that you are the bestest??? :P</td>', 'Yeah you would be crazy to think this wouldn''t do well. Now I''m getting tired of congratulating you so I''ll just be posting Irene fun facts from now on. :) Irene Fun Fact #1 (and yanko is very jealous of this. :P): - Not only is Irene very good but she sure can pick em! When she scores 6.5 or higher she has won a ribbon 40% of the time! That''s either very high or my percentage is low (i.e. 18%). So now that we got that out of the way can you PM me which challenges to enter and which to avoide? Thanks! Did I tell you that you are the bestest??? :P', '2008-08-06 01:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
