(4868681, 704173, 75034, '<td valign="top">Irene, First thing, congratulations on yet another ribbon. Second, I''m still trying to decipher the code (these things take time) so you''ll have to keep winning. Third, does it hurt to have all your creative juices flowing like that, shouldn''t you let a little out at a time, oh say like, let 10 or 20 challenges go by and  then turn it loose on us, or would it hurt to stop such creative genius??<br/> <br/>Any way, you know you rock and we are still waiting for your 8+ shot, so could you please WOW us sometime soon and stop holding back  :)~<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Irene, First thing, congratulations on yet another ribbon. Second, I''m still trying to decipher the code (these things take time) so you''ll have to keep winning. Third, does it hurt to have all your creative juices flowing like that, shouldn''t you let a little out at a time, oh say like, let 10 or 20 challenges go by and  then turn it loose on us, or would it hurt to stop such creative genius?? Any way, you know you rock and we are still waiting for your 8+ shot, so could you please WOW us sometime soon and stop holding back  :)~ MAX!', '2008-08-06 02:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4868685, 704427, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background or the lighting hurt you as both are more than fine. The problem I had with it is it''s a statue. You need to do more than just light it well to make it a compelling subject. The composition and POV isn''t doing you any favors either. As a product shot in a catelog it''s perfect but beyond that it doesn''t do anything else to excite the senses.</td>', 'I don''t think the background or the lighting hurt you as both are more than fine. The problem I had with it is it''s a statue. You need to do more than just light it well to make it a compelling subject. The composition and POV isn''t doing you any favors either. As a product shot in a catelog it''s perfect but beyond that it doesn''t do anything else to excite the senses.', '2008-08-06 02:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
