(4869116, 704173, 67152, '<td valign="top">Yawn, yawn, yawn....so, Miss Irene...you deliever another insanely good macro shot...yawn, yawn, yawn...<br/> <br/>A great shot Irene. I love how the drop works as a lens to blow up the details of the feather in more.  We can almost touch the delicate feel of the feather with this one.  Big congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Yawn, yawn, yawn....so, Miss Irene...you deliever another insanely good macro shot...yawn, yawn, yawn... A great shot Irene. I love how the drop works as a lens to blow up the details of the feather in more.  We can almost touch the delicate feel of the feather with this one.  Big congrats on the ribbon.', '2008-08-06 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4869117, 704173, 58785, '<td valign="top"><b>Second:</b> To those who gave 1 and 2''s ... even 3''s to this photo, please quit photography before you get hurt by dropping your stinking cameras to your head and bleed to death... There are safer things for you out there, like flipping burgers at local sandwich store. Just don''t use the grill.</td>', 'Second: To those who gave 1 and 2''s ... even 3''s to this photo, please quit photography before you get hurt by dropping your stinking cameras to your head and bleed to death... There are safer things for you out there, like flipping burgers at local sandwich store. Just don''t use the grill.', '2008-08-06 06:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
