(4869910, 704481, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hey, congratulations, Jeffrey!   I think the bowls are perfect.   It gives it even more of an abstract multi-shaped look.<br/></td>', 'Hey, congratulations, Jeffrey!   I think the bowls are perfect.   It gives it even more of an abstract multi-shaped look.', '2008-08-06 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
