(4869958, 704281, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   I love that place too!   Is that someone''s "cell" ???    It''s so warm and cozy, I think I''d love to be in prison there.    And I''m in awe that you got that focus hand held at 1/10.  <br/> <br/>I love this photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!   I love that place too!   Is that someone''s "cell" ???    It''s so warm and cozy, I think I''d love to be in prison there.    And I''m in awe that you got that focus hand held at 1/10.   I love this photo! ', '2008-08-06 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4869959, 704481, 66193, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, congrats!!  I saw the thumb on the front page and said to myself "hey that''s jeffrey''s idea.  who stole it?"  Looks like you put in quite an effort for this one.  Worth it, I think!  Congrats again.</td>', 'Jeffrey, congrats!!  I saw the thumb on the front page and said to myself "hey that''s jeffrey''s idea.  who stole it?"  Looks like you put in quite an effort for this one.  Worth it, I think!  Congrats again.', '2008-08-06 11:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4869968, 702989, 24454, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is a mass protest of the total lack of credibility the voters have in picking the proper photos to win awards.   I will join the club!!   Your scores SHOULD have been at least between your est. score and dream score.   You got robbed!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Looks like there is a mass protest of the total lack of credibility the voters have in picking the proper photos to win awards.   I will join the club!!   Your scores SHOULD have been at least between your est. score and dream score.   You got robbed! ', '2008-08-06 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
