(4869992, 704173, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your yellow and welcome to dpchallenge...getting a ribbon with your first entry is quite an accomplishment...keep up the good work ;)<br/> <br/>YOU AMAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE ME! Enzo </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL!! I''m a bit shy, this being my first entry and all... but thank you for being so kind and encouraging to a newbie. I''ll try and kep up the good work ;-))<br/>ENZO!! you''re lucky you live so far away from me or I''d come round and give you a BIG hug.</td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: Congratulations on your yellow and welcome to dpchallenge...getting a ribbon with your first entry is quite an accomplishment...keep up the good work ;) YOU AMAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE ME! Enzo  LOL!! I''m a bit shy, this being my first entry and all... but thank you for being so kind and encouraging to a newbie. I''ll try and kep up the good work ;-))ENZO!! you''re lucky you live so far away from me or I''d come round and give you a BIG hug.', '2008-08-06 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870004, 703656, 61961, '<td valign="top">This classic take on the theme was my challenge favorite -- I''m glad it made the top 20.</td>', 'This classic take on the theme was my challenge favorite -- I''m glad it made the top 20.', '2008-08-06 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870009, 704371, 52549, '<td valign="top">Ah! This was my favourite, I should have realized that this was your, Koka. It''s just SO your style and absolutely beautiful. Congrats on top 10.</td>', 'Ah! This was my favourite, I should have realized that this was your, Koka. It''s just SO your style and absolutely beautiful. Congrats on top 10.', '2008-08-06 11:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870014, 704444, 52549, '<td valign="top">VERY good. Love the composition and the lighting. Congrats on 5th place, Vikas.</td>', 'VERY good. Love the composition and the lighting. Congrats on 5th place, Vikas.', '2008-08-06 11:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870019, 704333, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, the colours are great. Also love the composition.</td>', 'Wonderful, the colours are great. Also love the composition.', '2008-08-06 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870021, 704224, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this was one of the most underrated photos.  I liked your composition and the simplicity of the arrangement.  Perhaps you lost some points due to the somewhat soft aspect of the bright white areass (maybe very slightly over-exposed?).  Anyway, good job overall.</td>', 'I think this was one of the most underrated photos.  I liked your composition and the simplicity of the arrangement.  Perhaps you lost some points due to the somewhat soft aspect of the bright white areass (maybe very slightly over-exposed?).  Anyway, good job overall.', '2008-08-06 11:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870023, 704005, 85097, '<td valign="top">Well I will say I am disappointed in this score.  This is a hard shot to pull off, and I hate that people voted it down because its "overdone" here.  But such is life.</td>', 'Well I will say I am disappointed in this score.  This is a hard shot to pull off, and I hate that people voted it down because its "overdone" here.  But such is life.', '2008-08-06 11:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870028, 703930, 52549, '<td valign="top">Now, this is absolutely GORGEOUS. It would make a fantastic print. I''d definitely have it on my wall if it were mine. Excellent work, Alice.</td>', 'Now, this is absolutely GORGEOUS. It would make a fantastic print. I''d definitely have it on my wall if it were mine. Excellent work, Alice.', '2008-08-06 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870035, 702989, 52549, '<td valign="top">MAK, this is indeed truly beautiful and a great example of Still Life. I really can''t understand why it didn''t score higher...</td>', 'MAK, this is indeed truly beautiful and a great example of Still Life. I really can''t understand why it didn''t score higher...', '2008-08-06 11:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870039, 703767, 90440, '<td valign="top">congratulation!!!....</td>', 'congratulation!!!....', '2008-08-06 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870044, 704475, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic, I like it just the way it is. The shadows and mood created are great.</td>', 'This is fantastic, I like it just the way it is. The shadows and mood created are great.', '2008-08-06 12:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870047, 704160, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Another very underrated image.</td>', 'Beautiful! Another very underrated image.', '2008-08-06 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870049, 704191, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting. I really like this.</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting. I really like this.', '2008-08-06 12:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870050, 702989, 61961, '<td valign="top">This was in my top few votes as well.  I''m not sure if you exactly nailed the "still life composition" aspect, but it''s pretty darn good.  However, I loved your natural lighting and the fact that you went for a classic definition of still life rather than just "an object".</td>', 'This was in my top few votes as well.  I''m not sure if you exactly nailed the "still life composition" aspect, but it''s pretty darn good.  However, I loved your natural lighting and the fact that you went for a classic definition of still life rather than just "an object".', '2008-08-06 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870060, 704192, 61961, '<td valign="top">I scored "tough" on this challenge, and this got one of my highest votes.  I appreciate that it is a still life composition rather than merely an object.  Lovely soft lighting and colors.</td>', 'I scored "tough" on this challenge, and this got one of my highest votes.  I appreciate that it is a still life composition rather than merely an object.  Lovely soft lighting and colors.', '2008-08-06 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870070, 704475, 6845, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this didn''t do better. I thought it would, I wonder how many people didn''t even pay attention to the shadow. Keep up the great work.</td>', 'I am surprised this didn''t do better. I thought it would, I wonder how many people didn''t even pay attention to the shadow. Keep up the great work.', '2008-08-06 12:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870084, 703999, 6845, '<td valign="top">Man, I just don''t know anymore. This was by far one of the best images in the whole challenge and it should have finished a lot better than this. I think it is a fantastic shot and a great still life. Don''t let it get you down, keep up the great work!</td>', 'Man, I just don''t know anymore. This was by far one of the best images in the whole challenge and it should have finished a lot better than this. I think it is a fantastic shot and a great still life. Don''t let it get you down, keep up the great work!', '2008-08-06 12:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870091, 704481, 40718, '<td valign="top">OK, since I haven''t heard you bust on me in a while for not stepping out of my comfort zone, I''ll refrain from doing the same to you. ;)  Oh wait...too late.  Where''ve you been these days?  I haven''t seen you much on the boards.</td>', 'OK, since I haven''t heard you bust on me in a while for not stepping out of my comfort zone, I''ll refrain from doing the same to you. ;)  Oh wait...too late.  Where''ve you been these days?  I haven''t seen you much on the boards.', '2008-08-06 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870104, 704442, 6845, '<td valign="top">Well i am not sure what to sys duds, other than i would have never guessed this image wouldn''t even break into the 5''s, but hey now is your time to bounce back with another ribbon!</td>', 'Well i am not sure what to sys duds, other than i would have never guessed this image wouldn''t even break into the 5''s, but hey now is your time to bounce back with another ribbon!', '2008-08-06 12:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
