(4870123, 704475, 96477, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how you got the shadow of the glass on the right side, could you tell us a a little about how that was done because based on what is visible that shadow does not seem possible.</td>', 'I don''t understand how you got the shadow of the glass on the right side, could you tell us a a little about how that was done because based on what is visible that shadow does not seem possible.', '2008-08-06 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870156, 704349, 34192, '<td valign="top">In a challenge with a different, more fitting, topic, this probably would have done much better.  The DPC crowd is kind of a stickler for meeting the topic.  Still lifes tend not to include people and/or animals, so some people would vote you lower on that alone.  Additionally, on some monitors, your image may be seen to have blown highlights.  I like the way the image looks and probably would have given it a 6.</td>', 'In a challenge with a different, more fitting, topic, this probably would have done much better.  The DPC crowd is kind of a stickler for meeting the topic.  Still lifes tend not to include people and/or animals, so some people would vote you lower on that alone.  Additionally, on some monitors, your image may be seen to have blown highlights.  I like the way the image looks and probably would have given it a 6.', '2008-08-06 12:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4870177, 704349, 27373, '<td valign="top">First, I think your score was hurt by people that didn''t think this was a still life.  Now, on to the photo.  A couple things jump out at me at first that I don''t like.  The background could be improved by removing the couch, I think a full white background would improve the image.  The out of focus elements (primarily the child) would have been a bit better had they been a little more in focus.  A bit more nit picky, I think the pile of stuff is a bit too much, it seems more like clutter to me.  I probably would have gone with keys, phone and watch.  Would any of this improved your score- I have no idea.</td>', 'First, I think your score was hurt by people that didn''t think this was a still life.  Now, on to the photo.  A couple things jump out at me at first that I don''t like.  The background could be improved by removing the couch, I think a full white background would improve the image.  The out of focus elements (primarily the child) would have been a bit better had they been a little more in focus.  A bit more nit picky, I think the pile of stuff is a bit too much, it seems more like clutter to me.  I probably would have gone with keys, phone and watch.  Would any of this improved your score- I have no idea.', '2008-08-06 12:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
