(4871083, 704173, 85556, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. This one and the Outtake. I interested how you accomplished the lighting and the stillness. Usually in these type of shots with feathers, there is always movement. Especially from cooling fans.<br/> <br/>Great shots.<br/> <br/>M.H.</td>', 'Love the lighting. This one and the Outtake. I interested how you accomplished the lighting and the stillness. Usually in these type of shots with feathers, there is always movement. Especially from cooling fans. Great shots. M.H.', '2008-08-06 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
