(4871172, 702417, 77262, '<td valign="top">After the challenge....i have no words i was once again unrated never mind, i love my work and at the end of the day is what is most important, am good at landscapes, haven''t explored other bits in photography. but i will keep submitting and entering challenges.<br/> <br/>To lemeryj; No i didn''t touched anything in the shot the rocks were there, i even thing that those rocks are the responsibles for the round hole, as it gets covered from time to time with the tide and cause the hole to get bigger and bigger. <br/> <br/>anyway see u all soon in the next submit</td>', 'After the challenge....i have no words i was once again unrated never mind, i love my work and at the end of the day is what is most important, am good at landscapes, haven''t explored other bits in photography. but i will keep submitting and entering challenges. To lemeryj; No i didn''t touched anything in the shot the rocks were there, i even thing that those rocks are the responsibles for the round hole, as it gets covered from time to time with the tide and cause the hole to get bigger and bigger.  anyway see u all soon in the next submit', '2008-08-06 18:54:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4871216, 704173, 56658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/><b>Irene Fun Fact #1</b> (and yanko is very jealous of this. :P):<br/> <br/>- Not only is Irene very good but she sure can pick em! When she scores 6.5 or higher she has won a ribbon 40% of the time! That''s either very high or my percentage is low (i.e. 18%). So now that we got that out of the way can you PM me which challenges to enter and which to avoid? Thanks! Did I tell you that you are the bestest??? :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Here''s an Irene fun fact for ya. Irene has entered 182 challenges and finished in the top 25 96 times (53%) and has finished in every position between 1 and 25 except 15th. So try, try, try as she might Irene just can''t finish 15th place.<br/> <br/>Congrats on yet another ribbon!</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Irene Fun Fact #1 (and yanko is very jealous of this. :P): - Not only is Irene very good but she sure can pick em! When she scores 6.5 or higher she has won a ribbon 40% of the time! That''s either very high or my percentage is low (i.e. 18%). So now that we got that out of the way can you PM me which challenges to enter and which to avoid? Thanks! Did I tell you that you are the bestest??? :P   Here''s an Irene fun fact for ya. Irene has entered 182 challenges and finished in the top 25 96 times (53%) and has finished in every position between 1 and 25 except 15th. So try, try, try as she might Irene just can''t finish 15th place. Congrats on yet another ribbon!', '2008-08-06 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4871260, 704166, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the kitchy look of this. I don''t mean that in a negative way, just far out. Reminds me of deep red lipstick with big purple and red bows. And throw in some polka dots too.<br/> <br/>I like the lighting and tilt. Lots of fun and very different.</td>', 'Love the kitchy look of this. I don''t mean that in a negative way, just far out. Reminds me of deep red lipstick with big purple and red bows. And throw in some polka dots too. I like the lighting and tilt. Lots of fun and very different.', '2008-08-06 19:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4871264, 704430, 66384, '<td valign="top">Hi Dave, love your composition and bright crisp focus. I hope you are putting this equipment to its intended use this summer.</td>', 'Hi Dave, love your composition and bright crisp focus. I hope you are putting this equipment to its intended use this summer.', '2008-08-06 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
