(4872103, 704171, 80058, '<td valign="top">Wow I am HUGELY disapointed with the votes not only on my own entry but others amazing classic still life images that scored so low! In my opinion one of the worst voting overall EVER! <br/> <br/>Como o Away de Petropolis diz: NAO GOSTO MAIS DE VOCE, FIM DE PAPO!!</td>', 'Wow I am HUGELY disapointed with the votes not only on my own entry but others amazing classic still life images that scored so low! In my opinion one of the worst voting overall EVER!  Como o Away de Petropolis diz: NAO GOSTO MAIS DE VOCE, FIM DE PAPO!!', '2008-08-07 05:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
