(4873978, 703930, 68504, '<td valign="top">Slick and modern and classic.</td>', 'Slick and modern and classic.', '2008-08-08 00:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4873981, 703848, 70265, '<td valign="top">Whether it''s a child, an older person, a still life, you really have an eye. By the way, IMO this should have made top 10, at least.</td>', 'Whether it''s a child, an older person, a still life, you really have an eye. By the way, IMO this should have made top 10, at least.', '2008-08-08 00:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874025, 703097, 68504, '<td valign="top">Lovely arrangement and light. No mean accomplishment considering the number of fruits/vegetables which have significant tops/stems and bottoms AND having the light do justice to both these features and the textures overall.  (Enjoyed your description of getting the natural light right - I prefer natural light and have done a few similar things but not with your thoroughness nor indeed your result). It is just possible that a slight shift in hue from blue to yellow would give this the classic feel that your assemblage suggests. Oh, and I don''t notice the dust, but that might be my own survival tactic.</td>', 'Lovely arrangement and light. No mean accomplishment considering the number of fruits/vegetables which have significant tops/stems and bottoms AND having the light do justice to both these features and the textures overall.  (Enjoyed your description of getting the natural light right - I prefer natural light and have done a few similar things but not with your thoroughness nor indeed your result). It is just possible that a slight shift in hue from blue to yellow would give this the classic feel that your assemblage suggests. Oh, and I don''t notice the dust, but that might be my own survival tactic.', '2008-08-08 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874032, 703801, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing composition and a nice feel to the colours and textures.</td>', 'Very pleasing composition and a nice feel to the colours and textures.', '2008-08-08 00:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874041, 703962, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the basket and the dark. Perhaps there is just a little too much contrast, and there could be more space above.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the basket and the dark. Perhaps there is just a little too much contrast, and there could be more space above.', '2008-08-08 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874053, 703999, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very fine. Not sure about the frame, and not sure means not sure: I wonder if the light line in it is just too light, as I am finding it distracting and/or competing with the wonderful subtle light tones in the photo.</td>', 'Very fine. Not sure about the frame, and not sure means not sure: I wonder if the light line in it is just too light, as I am finding it distracting and/or competing with the wonderful subtle light tones in the photo.', '2008-08-08 00:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874062, 704129, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great apples and lighting. (But I want to nitpick; your background material is just not doing you any favours.  I do believe that backdrops are tremendously important although I very very very rarely come up with anything satisfactory myself, and that they are part of the art and discipline).</td>', 'Great apples and lighting. (But I want to nitpick; your background material is just not doing you any favours.  I do believe that backdrops are tremendously important although I very very very rarely come up with anything satisfactory myself, and that they are part of the art and discipline).', '2008-08-08 00:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
