(4874965, 703880, 90579, '<td valign="top">Although I missed this challenge for voting. I love this picture!! Beautiful!</td>', 'Although I missed this challenge for voting. I love this picture!! Beautiful!', '2008-08-08 09:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875228, 704173, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another great shot Irene!</td>', 'Congrats on another great shot Irene!', '2008-08-08 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875312, 703300, 91496, '<td valign="top">One thing that no one has mentioned is that still life typically has a group of objects that are all within the frame.  Given that none of your objects are fully contained within the frame it seems more "dynamic" than "still" .  The topic is a killer as well. Lice eeewwwww!  Technically, the lighting and composition are nice.  I did not vote, but I suspect that the 1''s and 2''s are DNMC votes rather than bad photo votes.</td>', 'One thing that no one has mentioned is that still life typically has a group of objects that are all within the frame.  Given that none of your objects are fully contained within the frame it seems more "dynamic" than "still" .  The topic is a killer as well. Lice eeewwwww!  Technically, the lighting and composition are nice.  I did not vote, but I suspect that the 1''s and 2''s are DNMC votes rather than bad photo votes.', '2008-08-08 12:27:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875762, 704152, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this - so gorgeous.  The goblet is definitely beautiful.  I love the set-up with the bread and grapes.  I agree with the others - should have finished higher!</td>', 'I love the lighting in this - so gorgeous.  The goblet is definitely beautiful.  I love the set-up with the bread and grapes.  I agree with the others - should have finished higher!', '2008-08-08 16:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875769, 704152, 30982, '<td valign="top">This really is lovely.  Peaceful, warm and inviting.  And that goblet is beautiful.</td>', 'This really is lovely.  Peaceful, warm and inviting.  And that goblet is beautiful.', '2008-08-08 16:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875907, 703623, 24896, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> For the record I gave this a 6.  I like it, although a bit of dodge around the subject would have made it stand out more.  It is a little dark for the eyes to focus properly and this would be even more so on an uncalibrated monitor! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just like Judi said...but I gave it an 8. A tad of highlight dodge and this would have been a ten for me. Too bad about the score Dude!</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: For the record I gave this a 6.  I like it, although a bit of dodge around the subject would have made it stand out more.  It is a little dark for the eyes to focus properly and this would be even more so on an uncalibrated monitor!   Just like Judi said...but I gave it an 8. A tad of highlight dodge and this would have been a ten for me. Too bad about the score Dude!', '2008-08-08 17:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876046, 704173, 57570, '<td valign="top">I knew this would be yours...lovely shot...congrats!</td>', 'I knew this would be yours...lovely shot...congrats!', '2008-08-08 19:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876422, 704399, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect - I find myself wanting to move the bright shells out of the way to see the texture of the deck.  Maybe a little less brightening would have made the shells hold my interest more?</td>', 'Interesting effect - I find myself wanting to move the bright shells out of the way to see the texture of the deck.  Maybe a little less brightening would have made the shells hold my interest more?', '2008-08-09 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876425, 704382, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit too jumbled.  I wonder how it would look with just the lower right stuff, so the squash were on the left edge?</td>', 'I think this is a bit too jumbled.  I wonder how it would look with just the lower right stuff, so the squash were on the left edge?', '2008-08-09 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876428, 704430, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun composition.  And wow, your commenters LOVED it!</td>', 'Fun composition.  And wow, your commenters LOVED it!', '2008-08-09 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876434, 704166, 60862, '<td valign="top">Man, no comments just sucks, esp. with that score.  You have my sympathy.<br/> <br/>I don''t understand the score.  I think the tilt, colors, and composition are all interesting.  But I can guess at some of the things that people dinged you for: blur on the glasses'' base and the blown highlights on the berries.  But still, this would''ve been a 6 from me had I voted.</td>', 'Man, no comments just sucks, esp. with that score.  You have my sympathy. I don''t understand the score.  I think the tilt, colors, and composition are all interesting.  But I can guess at some of the things that people dinged you for: blur on the glasses'' base and the blown highlights on the berries.  But still, this would''ve been a 6 from me had I voted.', '2008-08-09 00:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876436, 703558, 60862, '<td valign="top">A very sharp, nice dandelion shot.  I''m guessing people just hammered it for DNMC, since I think still life usually means arranged objects, not something you find outside.</td>', 'A very sharp, nice dandelion shot.  I''m guessing people just hammered it for DNMC, since I think still life usually means arranged objects, not something you find outside.', '2008-08-09 00:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876439, 704265, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the flower and the blue base.  The background''s distracting, though, and I don''t see the blue color working well with the rich red/purple of the curtain.  Did you try the same subject against a solid curtain?</td>', 'I like the flower and the blue base.  The background''s distracting, though, and I don''t see the blue color working well with the rich red/purple of the curtain.  Did you try the same subject against a solid curtain?', '2008-08-09 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876444, 704451, 60862, '<td valign="top">If this is what you wanted to create, then I can''t comment.  But assuming you''d like feedback on why it scored as low as it did, here''s what I think.<br/> <br/>First, still life means arranged objects (or so I understand), with careful thought to how each element is placed and lit.  So the DNMC crowd probably hammered this pretty hard.<br/> <br/>Second, I think people''s eyes are drawn to bright things, like your background, but that ends up distracting viewers from the subject.<br/> <br/>Finally, the flower''s too far to the right, and too low contrast, to hold my interest.<br/> <br/>The upshot is to keep trying other flower shots, but not in a still life challenge. :)</td>', 'If this is what you wanted to create, then I can''t comment.  But assuming you''d like feedback on why it scored as low as it did, here''s what I think. First, still life means arranged objects (or so I understand), with careful thought to how each element is placed and lit.  So the DNMC crowd probably hammered this pretty hard. Second, I think people''s eyes are drawn to bright things, like your background, but that ends up distracting viewers from the subject. Finally, the flower''s too far to the right, and too low contrast, to hold my interest. The upshot is to keep trying other flower shots, but not in a still life challenge. :)', '2008-08-09 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876445, 704024, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the subjects and arrangement, but the muted colors don''t grab me.  Going all the way to monochrome might have worked better.  Given the "old-time" feel, maybe sepia or brown would have worked better.</td>', 'I like the subjects and arrangement, but the muted colors don''t grab me.  Going all the way to monochrome might have worked better.  Given the "old-time" feel, maybe sepia or brown would have worked better.', '2008-08-09 00:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877264, 704218, 62357, '<td valign="top">I was just looking thinking, this would have scored higher if it were not for the border.  The pic itself is very nice.</td>', 'I was just looking thinking, this would have scored higher if it were not for the border.  The pic itself is very nice.', '2008-08-09 15:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877595, 704427, 44877, '<td valign="top">A still life is a composition of inanimate objects. Here you have no composition at all. It''s one inanimate object, but since nothing is arranged, it bears little interest. Google still life painting, and still life photography and take a look at the images - that will give you an idea of the concept of still life.</td>', 'A still life is a composition of inanimate objects. Here you have no composition at all. It''s one inanimate object, but since nothing is arranged, it bears little interest. Google still life painting, and still life photography and take a look at the images - that will give you an idea of the concept of still life.', '2008-08-09 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877610, 703451, 82749, '<td valign="top">Andrew, congrats on <strike>6th</strike> 5th place, great subject.  Like the subdued reflections as well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-10 11:27:33.</i></td>', 'Andrew, congrats on 6th 5th place, great subject.  Like the subdued reflections as well.', '2008-08-09 21:44:22.000000', '2008-08-10 12:27:33.000000', 0),
(4877613, 703880, 82749, '<td valign="top">Congrats on <strike>11th place</strike> the top ten.  Very nice composition, details are great.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-10 11:28:18.</i></td>', 'Congrats on 11th place the top ten.  Very nice composition, details are great.', '2008-08-09 21:45:45.000000', '2008-08-10 12:28:18.000000', 0),
(4877694, 704427, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is well taken but its someone else''s art.  As someone said, as a product shot in a catalog, this is perfect; otherwise, it marble on a plain white background.  You''re not giving anyone any emotional depth in this image. This image of yours <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=673587" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/673587.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/673587.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/854/120/673587.jpg"/></a> <br/>gives me much more emotion and a little bit of you so it is a much better image in my eyes.</td>', 'This is well taken but its someone else''s art.  As someone said, as a product shot in a catalog, this is perfect; otherwise, it marble on a plain white background.  You''re not giving anyone any emotional depth in this image. This image of yours  gives me much more emotion and a little bit of you so it is a much better image in my eyes.', '2008-08-09 23:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
