(4878301, 703767, 67152, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> Seems like a new member here. Maybe he didn''t understand the rules. Maybe there is some Photoshop work done that he didn''t know was against the rules?<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> DQ sucks. Why wouldn''t you give your original?<br/> <br/>This rule should be modified to at least give the member one week to reply. </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>DQs are very unfortunate...but this individual has been around the site for more than a year, so they had time to understand the rules about retaining unedited files.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: Seems like a new member here. Maybe he didn''t understand the rules. Maybe there is some Photoshop work done that he didn''t know was against the rules? Originally posted by Jac: DQ sucks. Why wouldn''t you give your original? This rule should be modified to at least give the member one week to reply.    DQs are very unfortunate...but this individual has been around the site for more than a year, so they had time to understand the rules about retaining unedited files.', '2008-08-10 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
