(4881236, 704155, 56797, '<td valign="top">this is a tough crowd for bratz in a still life, I did it the last still life challenge. didn''t work out too well for me either. :P <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=334814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/495/120/334814.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/495/120/334814.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/495/120/334814.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Technically your shot is very well done though. The lighting and color saturation are great. Best of luck with your future shots.<br/> <br/>Crystal</td>', 'this is a tough crowd for bratz in a still life, I did it the last still life challenge. didn''t work out too well for me either. :P   Technically your shot is very well done though. The lighting and color saturation are great. Best of luck with your future shots. Crystal', '2008-08-11 19:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
