(4883709, 703767, 24454, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CassieDoodle:</b></div><hr/><i> that is my opinion, and by the looks of it i am in the minority. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, you are very much in the minority.  I don''t think the whites are muddy at all, and the lighting is beautiful, as is the overall wow factor and the composition.<br/> <br/>I am so sorry about your grandmother!  She can count on my prayers.  And I agree:  There will be plenty of redemption ribbons for you!   Keep turning out photos like this, and we''ll be seeing you in a week or two!<br/> <br/>***  Hugs for you and for your grandmother ***</td>', 'Originally posted by CassieDoodle: that is my opinion, and by the looks of it i am in the minority.  Yes, you are very much in the minority.  I don''t think the whites are muddy at all, and the lighting is beautiful, as is the overall wow factor and the composition. I am so sorry about your grandmother!  She can count on my prayers.  And I agree:  There will be plenty of redemption ribbons for you!   Keep turning out photos like this, and we''ll be seeing you in a week or two! ***  Hugs for you and for your grandmother ***', '2008-08-12 20:28:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4883810, 704236, 86379, '<td valign="top">very cool shot...i love the b&amp;w...can''t believe it didn''t score higher in the challenge. well done :)</td>', 'very cool shot...i love the b&w...can''t believe it didn''t score higher in the challenge. well done :)', '2008-08-12 21:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4884852, 703767, 60460, '<td valign="top">I think, I''m very lucky to have some friends like you. (crying ...)<br/> <br/>You are very kind to me.<br/> <br/>I never forget it.<br/> <br/>Thank you, all of you.<br/> <br/>YOU ARE THE BEST.</td>', 'I think, I''m very lucky to have some friends like you. (crying ...) You are very kind to me. I never forget it. Thank you, all of you. YOU ARE THE BEST.', '2008-08-13 03:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4884867, 703169, 96735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by redjulep:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this. You may get slammed for the lighting (or maybe not), but this really tells a story and your title is awesome. And it is in fact a still life - not so many of those in the still life challenge. 6 from me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your comments . Appreciated .</td>', 'Originally posted by redjulep: I like this. You may get slammed for the lighting (or maybe not), but this really tells a story and your title is awesome. And it is in fact a still life - not so many of those in the still life challenge. 6 from me.   Thank you for your comments . Appreciated .', '2008-08-13 03:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885553, 704152, 42495, '<td valign="top">This turned out really well, Alicia.  When I see this I want to be there and drink and eat, so you were quite successful in drawing me in.</td>', 'This turned out really well, Alicia.  When I see this I want to be there and drink and eat, so you were quite successful in drawing me in.', '2008-08-13 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 0),
