(5028521, 703101, 97635, '<td valign="top">You need to really work on your own photos and become a better photographer before you try critiquing other peoples work, as it is obvious that you have the slightest clue as to what a good photograph portrays and involoves.</td>', 'You need to really work on your own photos and become a better photographer before you try critiquing other peoples work, as it is obvious that you have the slightest clue as to what a good photograph portrays and involoves.', '2008-10-28 04:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5028748, 703101, 91197, '<td valign="top">This is sooooooooo... cool. I really like it. Machines are big and symmetrical and the only (lonely) guy is symmetrically divided. This photo is so empty. Please post more....      <br/> <br/>4.8 is not so bad . This place have rules. <br/>Remember the <b>stronger </b>one is not been DNMCed. <br/>But i think that <b>the best rule</b> is be yourself and listen to comments through your own ears.</td>', 'This is sooooooooo... cool. I really like it. Machines are big and symmetrical and the only (lonely) guy is symmetrically divided. This photo is so empty. Please post more....       4.8 is not so bad . This place have rules. Remember the stronger one is not been DNMCed. But i think that the best rule is be yourself and listen to comments through your own ears.', '2008-10-28 09:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
