(5389427, 703623, 39343, '<td valign="top">I had a similar reaction to the image I posted in this challenge.  I like this a lot!  It''s definitely not too dark in my opinion.  It''s the type of image that makes me stop and look a little closer at it.  Great job!</td>', 'I had a similar reaction to the image I posted in this challenge.  I like this a lot!  It''s definitely not too dark in my opinion.  It''s the type of image that makes me stop and look a little closer at it.  Great job!', '2009-03-18 11:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
